{"id":"vod_sn_149883","vodId":"149883","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"被追放的转生重骑士用游戏知识开无双","name_cn":"被追放的转生重骑士用游戏知识开无双","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至17集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20260703-1/b764c619df8fef81427459986059903b.jpg"},"summary":"　　“重骑士”——那是一个以防御为主，吸引敌人攻击以保护队友的职业。然而，与其他防御职业相比，其性能缺乏灵活性，攻击性能过低，导致连等级都难以正常提升。因此，它被称为超越了“不幸”的“缺陷”职业。出生于代代相传“剑圣”血脉的埃德温伯爵家的埃尔玛，在作为继承人的重要仪式“加护仪式”中，觉醒了被称为“缺陷”职业的“重骑士”，不仅失去了下一任家主的地位，还被不公正地放逐了。然而，在那时他恢复了前世的记忆，并意识到这个世界与他生前沉迷的 VR 在线游戏《Magic World》完全相同。然后，埃尔玛知道了。“重骑士”才是最强的职业……被伯爵家放逐后成为独行冒险者的埃尔玛，充分利用生前的知识，开始高效地攻略这个世界。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-10-23 09:39:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":17,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/03/wKu6mcWxGA27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202607/10/FkfUNSUXVK27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/17/yPw2XUu9Mc27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202607/24/6nhJpMbQ7t27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202607/31/gPXeymH4yf27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/07/LSg4UEEvyH27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/14/ra6nvSHEkX27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202608/21/6EpTL512nA27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202608/28/Y0Qk87NPXq27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202609/04/0B9JmCdxvT27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v13.rstu6.com/202609/11/m1kaspMsy027/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202609/18/DMVF9pGA2B27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v14.rstu6.com/202609/25/kDA9iNxuir27/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v15.rst